Subject: IMPORTANT!! Rkoholik beginner's course announcement
Message-ID: <dZOlAIZ7fLA._GdN8NB1Em4J@rkoholiki.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/rkoholiki/c/dZOlAIZ7fLA/m/_GdN8NB1Em4J>
